Record tiles with a bounding box hierarchy when they are replayed more than once.

WebKit 316802@main (bug 318942), adapted to 2.52.6: the recording of the
dirty tiles of a layer is replayed once per tile, and without an R-tree
every replay walks every operation of the recording, clipped away or not.
With one, each replay uses only the operations that intersect its tile.

